  "root_problem": "Billing dispute tickets roughly doubled since August 2026 (E-07) primarily because billing import validation rule BV-17, deployed 2026-08-01 with no unit conversion (unit_scaling: none, E-12), misclassifies normal consumption from v4.2 AMI meters — which report registers in 0.1 m3 while BV-17 compares them against 12-month m3 history (E-13) — as high-consumption outliers, causing valid AMI reads to be wrongly rejected at import and estimate-substituted; this mechanism explains 1,184 of the 1,240 ESTIMATED-read disputed bills (E-11), while its reach into the 1,785 ACTUAL-read disputed bills (E-03) is not yet confirmed."
 },
